  "label": "Meme Format: Tragedy for Comedy",
  "description": "The meme format relies on the juxtaposition of a deeply tragic real-life scenario with a visually dramatic image to create dark humor or shock value. This is a specific internet meme convention that requires knowledge of meme culture — how memes are constructed to elicit emotional responses (often through irony or absurdity) — to understand the intent behind the image and text.",
